WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.124
The question asks whether online learning should replace classroom learning.
State your position clearly. One possible position is that online lessons should
complement classroom teaching.

00:00:12.124 --> 00:00:25.315
Develop each main idea with an explanation and a relevant example. Recorded
lessons offer flexibility for workers. Classroom discussion can support
interaction and group activities.

00:00:25.315 --> 00:00:36.751
Your conclusion should answer the original question and remain consistent with
your introduction. Summarize the main reasons. Avoid invented statistics or
studies.

